  "statement": "Let \\(f(x)=\\frac{1}{1-x}\\). Let \\(f^{k+1}(x)=f\\left(f^{k}(x)\\right)\\), with \\(f^{1}(x)=f(x)\\). What is \\(f^{2008}(2008)\\) ?",
  "answerChoices": [],
